ts=2026-06-15T17:18:11.628Z type=context scope=pass-gui content="pass-gui: Desktop GUI for GNU Pass password manager. Stack: Vue 3.5 + Pinia 3 + NeutralinoJS 6.4 + TypeScript 5.9 + TailwindCSS 4 + shadcn-vue 2 + lib-result 5 + Zod 4 + Biome 2. pnpm workspace (root + client/). Auto-routing from pages/. Backend-first dev order: 1. Config/validation (DONE), 2. Readiness & env checks (IN PROGRESS), 3. Entry operations (NEXT), 4. Frontend (FUTURE), 5. Release (FAR FUTURE). Only Pinia store is counter stub. Only 3 pages: index (stub), about (stub), test (service debug). Full shadcn-vue sidebar suite installed but not wired. AppSidebar uses hardcoded sample data. dark/light mode works. No tests yet." tags=repo,architecture,tech-stack
ts=2026-06-15T17:18:16.608Z type=context scope=pass-gui content="Config system fully implemented: TOML via @ltd/j-toml with comment preservation. Zod schemas per section in config-validation.ts with cross-field validation (active_store must reference defined store). Default config in constants.ts. Platform-aware paths (Linux: ~/.config/pass-gui/config.toml, macOS: ~/Library/Application Support, Windows: %APPDATA%). Config validation done via validateAppConfig(). Config has getValue/setValue with generics." tags=config,validation,done
ts=2026-06-15T17:18:20.511Z type=context scope=pass-gui content="Code style: Biome 2.5.0 linter + formatter (no ESLint/Prettier). 2 spaces, 80 char width, LF, double quotes in JSX/HTML, ES5 trailing commas, semicolons always. noVar: on, useImportType: error, noExplicitAny: info, noImportCycles: error, noEnum: warn. Vue files override: off for useConst, useImportType, noUnusedVariables, noUnusedImports. useSortedClasses: warn (nursery). type over interface. Named functions preferred. Composition API with <script setup lang=\"ts\">. Setup stores (function form) for Pinia. PascalCase.vue components, kebab-case composables." tags=code-style,biome,conventions
